erted swiper-initialized swiper-horizontal swiper-backface-hidden\"><div class=\"swiper-wrapper\"><div class=\"swiper-slide ng-star-inserted swiper-slide-active\"><div fxlayout=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"\" fxflexfill=\"\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"swiper-slide__image desktop-view ng-star-inserted\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" alt=\"Umrah Package Deal\" width=\"1920\" height=\"600\" src=\"/-/media/SaudiaWebApp/data/media/img/Live-images/pages/saudia-holidays/umrah-hero-en.ashx?h=600&amp;iar=0&amp;w=1920&amp;rev=8231383609cd4629a07b18431398afae&amp;hash=A034CF4BC75ADD8B4291B0D831C419DD\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><!----><div class=\"image-gradient\" id=\"23cc46ab-0ffb-422b-af8d-a4d4dda0b961\"></div></div><!----><!----><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"swiper-slide__content\"><!----><!----><h1 appexcerpttext=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Apply for an Umrah Permit with Saudia &amp; Nusuk</span><!----></h1><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><div class=\"custom-pagination ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"container\"><div id=\"cpage_banner\" class=\"custom-pages\"></div></div></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></app-jss-image-link-list><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-space class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"cms-spacer-component\"></div></app-jss-space><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-title-text class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><!----><div class=\"title-text isCashMilesInView ng-star-inserted\"><!----><!----><!----><p appexcerpttext=\"\" class=\"titleTextSub ng-star-inserted\">\n\n<div class=\"sa-umrah-permits\">\n  <h2>How to get an Umrah Permit when traveling with Saudia</h2>\n  <p>\n    Passengers traveling on eligible Saudia flights to Jeddah or Taif can apply for an Umrah Permit through the integrated Nusuk platform. The permit process is designed to help pilgrims complete their Umrah journey smoothly while meeting the latest Saudi regulations.\n  </p>\n\n  <!-- Centered Button -->\n  <div class=\"button-center\">\n    <a href=\"https://www.saudia.com/eatamarna/add-booking\" class=\"btn\">Issue Permit</a>\n  </div>\n\n  <h2>Eligibility Requirements for an Umrah Permit</h2>\n  <h3>How to apply for an Umrah Permit?</h3>\n\n  <ul>\n    <li>You can apply for the Umrah Permit after issuing your travel ticket on eligible SAUDIA flights*.</li>\n    <li>The Umrah Permit issuance service is available for passengers traveling to the cities of Jeddah and Taif*.</li>\n    <li>Passenger eligibility will be verified by the Ministry of Hajj and Umrah.</li>\n    <li>Each guest requesting a permit must provide the mobile number registered in their Tawakkalna or Eatmarna account.</li>\n    <li>Once the permit issuance process is completed, the permit booking will appear in the Tawakkalna and Eatmarna applications.</li>\n    <li>An SMS message containing your permit booking details will be sent to you.</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <p class=\"note\">\n    *Service available for domestic flights only.\n  </p>\n</div>\n</p><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></app-jss-title-text><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-faq class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"faq-section ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"container\"><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.lt-lg=\"column\" fxlayoutgap=\"20px grid\" fxlayoutgap.gt-lg=\"24px grid\"><div fxflex.gt-lg=\"50\" class=\"faq__title\"><h2 class=\"primary-heading ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"\">Frequently Asked Questions</h2><!----><!----></div><div fxflex.gt-lg=\"50\"><mat-accordion class=\"mat-accordion faq__accordion\"><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-0 mat-expanded mat-expansion-panel-spacing ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator un-panel-class ng-tns-c2690051721-1 ng-tns-c1859850774-0 ng-animate-disabled mat-expanded mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"How do I apply for an Umrah permit through Saudia?\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-0\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-0\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-1\"><mat-panel-title id=\"expPanel\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-tns-c2690051721-1\"> How do I apply for an Umrah permit through Saudia? </mat-panel-title></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-1 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-0 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-0\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-0\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-0\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\"><p>Passengers can apply for an Umrah permit after booking an eligible Saudia flight and completing the required verification through the Nusuk platform.</p></p><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-2 ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator un-panel-class ng-tns-c2690051721-3 ng-tns-c1859850774-2 ng-animate-disabled mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"Is an Umrah permit required to perform Umrah?\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-1\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-3\"><mat-panel-title id=\"expPanel\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-tns-c2690051721-3\"> Is an Umrah permit required to perform Umrah? </mat-panel-title></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-3 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-2 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-1\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-1\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-2\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\"><p>Yes. Pilgrims must obtain the necessary permit through approved channels before performing Umrah, subject to current regulations.</p></p><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-4 ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator un-panel-class ng-tns-c2690051721-5 ng-tns-c1859850774-4 ng-animate-disabled mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"Can international travelers apply for an Umrah permit?\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-2\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-2\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-5\"><mat-panel-title id=\"expPanel\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-tns-c2690051721-5\"> Can international travelers apply for an Umrah permit? </mat-panel-title></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-5 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-4 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-2\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-2\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-4\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\"><p>Eligibility depends on the traveler's visa type and current Saudi regulations. Passengers should verify requirements before travel.</p></p><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-6 ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator un-panel-class ng-tns-c2690051721-7 ng-tns-c1859850774-6 ng-animate-disabled mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"How will I receive my Umrah permit?\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-3\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-3\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-7\"><mat-panel-title id=\"expPanel\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-tns-c2690051721-7\"> How will I receive my Umrah permit? </mat-panel-title></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-7 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-6 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-3\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-3\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-6\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\"><p>After approval, the permit details are sent to the registered mobile number and become available through the relevant applications.</p></p><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><!----></mat-accordion></div></div></div></div><!----></app-jss-faq><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><!----></sc-placeholder>"}